    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Sites down",
      "id": 26,
      "description": "Sites failing their blackbox check through the Gateway (or, for Forgejo and Vault, directly): the https and https_authelia modules. The probes dashboard (Services) has each one.\n\nCLI: `kubectl -n monitoring port-forward svc/blackbox-exporter 9115`, then `curl 'localhost:9115/probe?module=<module>&target=<target>&debug=true'`",
      "datasource": {
