      "id": 27,
      "description": "Pi-hole on its LoadBalancer IP (.100): local answers a local record, blocked a name on the block lists with 0.0.0.0, recursive the internet through Unbound.\n\nCLI: `dig @192.168.111.100 homepage.hirednoobs.com`, `dig @192.168.111.100 googlesyndication.com`, `dig @192.168.111.100 example.com`",
